# ─── A2A workspace task files ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Workspace task dirs (T-YYYY-NNN) are project-specific and should NOT be
# committed to the protocol/runtime repo.
# Keep: workspace/.gitkeep and workspace/active-task.md (template, null state)
.ai-agents/workspace/T-*/

# ─── Cursor IDE internal files ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# plans/ are IDE-generated workspace planning artifacts, not deliverables
.cursor/plans/
# Keep: .cursor/rules/ai-agents.mdc (project rule, IS a deliverable)

# ─── Environment / secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
secrets.json
credentials.json
